@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>This site uses a first-party analytics cookie to measure page views and sessions. Analytics records the requested page, referrer, browser user agent, response status, load time, a random session identifier, and a keyed one-way hash of the visitor’s IP address.</p>
<p>The analytics cookie lasts up to six months. Raw IP addresses are not stored and analytics data is not sold or used for advertising. Contact-form information is transmitted securely to FormSubmit for email delivery, may be retained there for up to 30 days, and is used only to respond to the submitted message.</p>

